# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout across all platforms. Without this,
# Git on Windows checks files out with CRLF (core.autocrlf), and oxfmt — which
# expects LF — reports every file as mis-formatted, failing `format:check` in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types Git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
